		(descr "SAO v1.69bis add-on connector: 2x3 2.54mm shrouded keyed SMD box header, XFCN BH254VS-6P (LCSC C492445). Drawing: https://www.lcsc.com/datasheet/C492445.pdf (land pattern 1.1 x 4.0 pads, 10.5 outer span; pads here are 1.1 x 4.4 for joint strength). Pin 1 VCC, 2 GND, 3 SDA, 4 SCL, 5 GPIO1, 6 GPIO2. Key slot is on the odd-pin side.")
